    "chunk_text": "The way in which external members of University Councils are appointed, again, I believe, is not open; there is a lot of secrecy. Therefore, I think these are serious changes that must happen because all that involves the culture we are trying to change and which the Government says it is committed to change. So, the point I am making is that when we make these comments, we make them in the best interest of what the Government says its objectives are and hoping that the Government would take on board certain things that we suggest."
